11 Testing
**********

The package includes 145 tests: 121 for the core, 16 for the navigation
menu, and 8 for the browser dashboard.  The last two groups run with
‘make test-nav’ and ‘make test-html’.

11.1 Running Tests
==================

11.1.1 From Command Line
------------------------

     # Run all tests
     make test

     # Run unit tests only
     make test-unit

     # Run integration tests
     make test-integration

     # Run with verbose output
     make test-verbose

11.1.2 From Within Emacs
------------------------

     M-x ert RET t RET

   Or load and run specific categories:

     (load-file "test-autoslip-roam.el")
     (ert-run-tests-interactively "^test-parse")

